        "official_en": "But don’t worry, I’ll be sure to use your fresh corpses for my experiments. You can help bring my dream to fruition. Could you wish for anything more?",
        "real_en": "Of course, I'll use your corpses for experiments to fulfill my dream. Isn't that quite a service?"
